Architecture Diagram Generator — assets/tedandlisa-template-architecture.html
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The architecture template's visual system — slate ground with a grid field,
JetBrains Mono typography, and the semantic component palette — is derived from
the Architecture Diagram Generator skill.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/Cocoon-AI/architecture-diagram-generator
  Author:    Cocoon AI
  License:   MIT
  Changes:   Derived, not copied. Rewritten as a MonoMind template: node colours
             moved from attributes to CSS classes so a theme is a token swap,
             a light palette added, English/Korean labels written inline, the
             MonoMind mark and chrome added, and the html2canvas/jsPDF exports
             replaced with print-to-PDF and a self-download so the file has no
             runtime dependency.

